    },
    {
      "step": "TR-10",
      "action": "OFFLINE on sto-S2: agt-BO-1 authors ev-INF2, a conflicting interpretation claiming to generalize the correction and supersede ev-REQB."
    },
    {
      "step": "TR-11",
      "action": "Reconnect. Run the remaining steps twice on independent fresh store pairs: ARM-X delivers ev-COR-A first then ev-INF2; ARM-Y delivers ev-INF2 first then ev-COR-A."
